0,Kyode language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kyode_language,"Kyode (Gikyode, Chode) is a Guang language of Ghana.",Gikyode,Niger-Congo
1,"Gikyode - Viquipèdia, l'enciclopèdia lliure",https://ca.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gikyode,"El gikyode (o el chode, o el kyode) és una llengua guang septentrional que parlen els akyodes a la regió Volta de Ghana. Hi ha entre 10.400 (2003) i 14.000 parlants de gikyode.",Gikyode,Niger-Congo
2,Gikyode Language (ACD) – L1 & L2 Speakers... | Ethnologue Free,https://www.ethnologue.com/language/acd/,Gikyode is a stable indigenous language of Ghana. It belongs to the Niger-Congo language family.,Gikyode,Niger-Congo
3,Gikyode - acd (Niger-Congo) - PeopleGroups.org,https://peoplegroups.org/language/acd/,"Gikyode (acd) is part of the Niger-Congo family and Niger-Congo, Atlantic-Congo, Volta-Congo, Kwa, Nyo, Potou-Tano, Tano, Guang, North Guang class. Gikyode speaking People Groups across the world: Fast Facts: Types.",Gikyode,Niger-Congo
